    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n73397" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὁμᾰλ-ισμός</span></b> , ὁ,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>levelling,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῆς γῆς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					LXX
					<u>Ba.</u>
					5.7
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Orib.
				49.12.1
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">καθ᾽ ὁμαλισμὸν ἀναγνωστέον</span> one
			must read <i>without a rise of pitch,</i> of enclitics, Sch.<i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Ag.</u>
				937
			</span></i>, Sch.<i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Pl.</u>
				414
			</span></i> ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡ κατὰ ὁ. [ἀπήχησις] ἐν τῇ βαρείᾳ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.T.
					630.1
				</span></i>
			.</div>
